# Generated vector stores. These are caches an example builds on first run --
# two of them were committed by accident, without their version manifests, so
# `list_tables()` found them and `open_table` rejected them. That crashed any
# example that actually opened one on a clean checkout.
# Unanchored on purpose: tool_vector_db builds its store at a path relative to
# the working directory, so running it from the repo root drops the database
# there rather than beside the example.
.tool_cache/
gantry_tools.lancedb/
